Output assets/warning_demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 800
Set Height 400
Set TypingSpeed 100ms

Type "cd ~/Developer/Experiments/rust-but-lisp"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "cat examples/error_let.lisp"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "cargo run -- compile examples/error_let.lisp"
Enter
Sleep 4s
